        },
        {
          "id": "hs-traces",
          "type": "insight",
          "severity": "positive",
          "heading": "Learning set — 430 real opportunities",
          "text": "Once you approve, Hunter traces **430** recent opportunities from your strongest sellers and healthiest customers. Every call, email, note, CRM history, and seller action on those deals becomes a decision trace for GTM learning — not a random sample of the whole book.",
