            {
              "label": "Opportunities to trace",
              "value": "430",
              "detail": "Most recent, strongest sellers"
            },
            {
              "label": "Signals per opp",
              "value": "5",
              "detail": "Call, email, note, CRM, actions"
            }
          ],
          "bottomLine": "**Bottom line:** Hunter learns from how your best reps actually win with healthy customers, then uses that to configure voice, workflows, and briefing cadences."
        },
        {
          "id": "hs-phase-1",
          "type": "insight",
          "severity": "neutral",
          "rank": 1,
          "heading": "Phase 1 — Org learning (~2 hours)",
          "text": "Build the org's GTM motion from those traces: stages, win/loss patterns, what customers buy, meeting rhythm, and house voice.",
